          description: "Nubra (headquarters Diskit), Sham (Khaltse) and Changthang (Nyoma) carved out of Leh, and Zanskar (Padum) and Drass (Drass-Ranbirpura) carved out of Kargil, taking Ladakh from two districts to seven.",
          implementation: "Approved by the Ministry of Home Affairs in August 2024 and formally notified on 27 April 2026; new district administrations are being staffed and equipped in phases."
